-- ===========================================================================
-- KisanLink - end-to-end demonstration scenario
--
-- EVERYTHING IN THIS FILE IS DEMONSTRATION DATA.
--
--   * The farmer, FPO and buyer accounts are fictional. The buyers are NOT
--     real verified commercial buyers and must never be described as such.
--   * The price history is SYNTHETIC. It is shaped to look like a plausible
--     Maharashtra tomato/onion series so the forecasting and recommendation
--     features can be demonstrated before real AGMARKNET data is ingested.
--     Every row is tagged source = 'SEED_DEMO' so the API can label it.
--
-- Replace this with verified government data before making any claim about
-- real prices.
--
-- All demo accounts use the password:  Kisan@123
--
-- Requires seed.sql to have been loaded first (crops, markets, storage).
-- Load with:  python -m scripts.init_db --seed --test-data
--
-- Dates are written relative to the current date, so the scenario stays
-- current however long after this file was written it is loaded.
-- ===========================================================================

